                    gap_underlying:         `An influence-and-courage gap — managers avoid cross-silo conflict and freeze on transformation trade-offs (the transcripts)`,
                    gap_strategy:           `A strategy-knowledge gap — they need more frameworks and analytical tools, as the label says`,
                    gap_presenting:         `Exactly what the brief says — build a "strategic leadership" course and deliver it`,
                    gap_talent:             `A talent gap — these simply aren't the right 300 people for transformation roles`,
